{"id":"vod_sn_37794","vodId":"37794","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"剑风传奇2016","name_cn":"剑风传奇2016","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7a3e1b6b95ca648fa598f418204aad66.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《烙印勇士》根据三浦健太郎创作的同名漫画改编。2015年12月21日由杂志《YoungAnimal》公开2016年启动全新的动画项目。2016年7月2日举办第1~2话特别先行上映会。在一个血统决定一切的社会里，并没有无所谓公正与公平。寄生在下层阶级上的贵族，不断以荣誉、服从、高贵及正统等方式来抹杀低层人类的存在。而在这样不平凡的社会里，出生于平民的格里菲斯以野心与才能造就了鹰之团盛名，并吸引了无数想达到上层的人们追随着，其中包含了战斗技巧十分高超的的佣兵战士格斯，但几乎对等的两人未能就此长久友好，命运之神却造就了一位手持巨剑、斩杀无数妖魔的屠魔狂战士。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fkj1kPmfCW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3Uupf7PxsX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BuA30t9ndq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RR2iBjM4re1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c8NzHaYDf31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9QXMEd9V6w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qPuRb18raS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aGuwtW3yHE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rFfDTaid4a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ets36fqm3L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q3KM897TTA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cnk6FHHUhc1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.650Z"}